{
  "_doc": "UI standard v1: the one home of the colors, sizes, gaps, field widths and type of every RADE window and app window (the Administrator, 2026-11-20; docs/ui-standard.md). engine/rade_build.py writes the block between the ui-tokens markers in engine/rade_ui.ps1 from this file (python3 engine/rade_tokens.py --write) and stops a build when that block is old; scripts/ui_tokens.py checks the contrast of every pair and writes the CSS block of index.html. Sizes are pixels at 100 % Windows scaling. 'colors' is the light set (Kanon in USAF colors) and 'dark' the dark set. A color's 'system' is the SystemColors role it takes while a Windows contrast theme is on. A face's 'file' is its font in engine/fonts (scripts/build_fonts.py makes them); '' = none yet: the window uses the face's fallback.",
